# 📅 Day 2 — Nmap Timing & Advanced Scanning

Day 2 focused on understanding **scan timing, packet behavior, firewall interaction, and advanced Nmap options.**

## ⏱️ Timing Templates

Explored Nmap timing templates:

```text
T0 → Paranoid
T1 → Sneaky
T2 → Polite
T3 → Normal
T4 → Aggressive
T5 → Insane
```

Also learned about:

```text
--min-parallelism
--max-parallelism
--min-hostgroup
--max-hostgroup
--initial-rtt-timeout
--max-rtt-timeout
--max-retries
--ttl
--host-timeout
```

## 🕐 Time Formats

Learned Nmap time-value formats:

```text
s → seconds
m → minutes
h → hours
```

## 📦 Scan Delay & Packet Rate

Explored:

```text
--scan-delay
--max-scan-delay
--min-rate
--max-rate
--defeat-rst-ratelimit
```

This helped me understand the relationship between:

**Scan speed ↔ Packet rate ↔ Network conditions ↔ Detection**

